WEBVTT

1
00:04:33.941 --> 00:04:34.941
Be careful.

2
00:04:51.667 --> 00:04:52.876
Fire!

3
00:05:03.470 --> 00:05:07.808
Go. Let's finish this.

4
00:05:10.144 --> 00:05:12.980
What was the name
of the Black American in Berlin?

5
00:05:13.522 --> 00:05:14.522
Jesse Owens.

6
00:05:16.233 --> 00:05:20.112
They all look the same.
But they don't all run the same.

7
00:05:22.865 --> 00:05:25.951
We're ten hours late. Let's go.

8
00:05:36.670 --> 00:05:38.797
-Let's go.
-I hate Lucky Strikes.

9
00:05:38.881 --> 00:05:41.133
-Shut your mouth. Faster!
-Yes. sir.

10
00:05:48.015 --> 00:05:50.350
Let Schmidt lie there.
We don't have time for him.

11
00:05:51.810 --> 00:05:52.810
Yes. sir.

12
00:05:58.901 --> 00:06:00.235
I said get in!
